{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy\u2019s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy\u2019s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact &amp; Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues, I would appreciate it if you could contact me via my Discord server or by DM on X (@tesakiza).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streaming and content guidelines are available at patreon.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dusk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/bc58909e173d5ccc473b3217b02b5cd09afd42ed.jpg"},{"name":"Day's End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/7cadde5ee24dca15e2b4187b1e37a5ca7eccfd13.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Hours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/d26d3a5fb2da1fb893b508957ad6decc3e1b2e90.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Midnight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/1826748e5493d2a46833ff305d255a46a3e23a7c.jpg"},{"name":"Morning Glimmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/eb45aba0c4886a252b54c4e88d409f6a3acc5298.jpg"},{"name":"Veiled Sunrise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/dc4ce2c813854a044df80e3952a4f8dfb5452887.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/a786fc58e8e9df4ec4e76d9b819e2637c9fb37d8.jpg"},{"name":"Vampire of the Battlefield","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/55907a2b4ade4bbcf350ae5ee715b43f0bb32516.jpg"},{"name":"SSS011","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/fa64d91e1fb5777f56014ce278cb167531d7fd90.jpg"},{"name":"Whoa!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425320/8cdd9b2c413e3a648040525b7a76b95fbe8794b6.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2425320?t=1756454413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756454413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/a5e05f0c984cc8c72eaa8170487baf168283afbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756454413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/a5e05f0c984cc8c72eaa8170487baf168283afbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756454413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy\u2019s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy\u2019s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact &amp; Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues, I would appreciate it if you could contact me via my Discord server or by DM on X (@tesakiza).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streaming and content guidelines are available at patreon.</p></li></ul>","developers":["tesakiza"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425320/header.jpg?t=1756454413","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2425320/455170625/c1ec95d81bebb0cfbce49bd836a3da92beac5149/1754734424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754737436","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2425320/455170625/c1ec95d81bebb0cfbce49bd836a3da92beac5149/1754734424/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754737436","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2425320/455170625/c1ec95d81bebb0cfbce49bd836a3da92beac5149/1754734424/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754737436","id":257180738,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180738/movie480.mp4?t=1754737436","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180738/movie_max.mp4?t=1754737436"},"name":"Introduction","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180738/441d7101ea6265152336be698fdbbaa2a9ad2ee9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754737436","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180738/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754737436","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180738/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754737436"}}],"name":"Blind Bullet","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["